        "ggK4_KbLllh_text": "<p>Chaque commande contient 4 tailles d’embouts. Vous testez et gardez celle qui vous convient.</p>",
        "ggPsXmScU5x_text": "<p>For eye tracking to work accurately, your headset needs to be correctly positioned on your head and in front of your eyes. Please see detailed instructions for positioning the headset and using eye tracking.</p>",
        "ggbniFAdpwr_text": "<p>Les bouchons mousse bloquent trop et isolent. Auryde™ réduit le vent sans vous couper complètement.</p>",
